        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, liquefied, production US, at freight ship</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, liquefied, production US, at freight ship
The process is normalized on the gaseous form of gas. The net calorific value of natural gas is 36.0 MJ/Nm³. UUID=c7b5d4ea-a856-31f1-b291-391863c45790
This dataset describes the transport of natural gas on a freight ship between the liquefaction plant in US and a Kuwaiti evaporation plant.
Location: not known
Technology: The distances between liquefaction and evaporation plant is based on port distances.
Time period: Transport modes investigated for 2023.
Production volume: not known
Sampling: Literature.
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c7b5d4ea-a856-31f1-b291-391863c45790.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
